give @s minecraft:written_book 1 0 {title:"RV · Field guide",author:"RV",generation:0,rvGuide:1b,rvGuideVersion:3,pages:["{\"text\":\"RV · Start here\\n\\nT — chat\\nE — inventory\\nJ — map\\n\\nMenu:\\n/trigger menu set 1\\n\\nLost this book?\\nMenu → Book\\n/trigger wbook set 1\"}","{\"text\":\"First launch\\n\\nIn Play, choose mouse\\nand keyboard or a\\nUSB controller.\\n\\nSelect your device\\nand check its axes.\\nThen choose a\\nserver.\\n\\nRepeat setup in\\nlauncher settings.\"}","{\"text\":\"Spawn\\n\\nShared lobby:\\nX: 0\\nY: 65\\nZ: -210\\n\\nReturn:\\n/trigger spawn set 1\\n\\nEveryone can use it.\\nChoose your team in\\nthe menu.\"}","{\"text\":\"Equipment\\n\\nMenu → Kit\\n/trigger kit set 1\\n\\nM4, ammo, food,\\narmour, tablet.\\n\\nUp to 3 impact FPVs;\\none Geran and one\\nFP-1.\"}","{\"text\":\"Resupply\\n\\n/trigger drone set 1\\nUp to 3 impact FPVs.\\n\\n/trigger wing set 1\\nGeran and FP-1.\\n\\nKeep free slots. Wait\\n5 seconds after a\\nsuccessful request.\"}","{\"text\":\"Weapons\\n\\nLeft click — fire\\nRight click — aim\\nR — reload\\n\\nNo response? Check\\nyour key bindings in\\nOptions → Controls.\"}","{\"text\":\"Tank\\n\\nRight click — enter.\\nW/A/S/D — drive.\\nMouse — aim.\\nLeft click — fire.\\n\\nG / middle click —\\nweapon.\\nZ — zoom.\\nY — exit.\\n\\nDefault keys.\\nCurrent keys: HUD.\"}","{\"text\":\"Ammunition\\n\\nR — reload.\\nI — vehicle cargo.\\n\\nCheck your\\nammunition and\\nselected weapon on\\nthe HUD.\\n\\nA passenger seat\\nmay not control the\\ncannon.\"}","{\"text\":\"Impact\\n\\nHIT · no damage — HP\\ndid not decrease.\\n\\nDAMAGE −N — lost N\\nHP.\\n\\nDESTROYED — target\\ndestroyed.\\n\\nThe server confirms\\nthis marker.\"}","{\"text\":\"Wounds\\n\\nLeave the vehicle.\\nH — check wounds.\\n\\nArms, legs, head and\\nbody have separate\\nhealth.\\n\\nCheck the binding:\\nOptions → Controls\\nFirst Aid\"}","{\"text\":\"Bandages\\n\\nHold a bandage or\\nplaster. Right-click.\\n\\nHold the injured body\\npart button until it\\nfinishes.\\n\\nHealing is gradual.\\nRefill supplies\\nthrough Kit.\"}","{\"text\":\"FPV quad\\n\\nPlace the FPV. Hold\\nthe tablet and\\nright-click the quad.\\n\\nMouse — look and\\nturn.\\nShift — exit.\\n\\nEasy is the standard\\nmouse and keyboard\\nmode.\"}","{\"text\":\"Flight · Easy\\n\\nW/S — forward/back\\nA/D — left/right\\nSpace — up\\nLeft Ctrl — down\\n\\nRelease the keys: the\\nquad brakes and\\nhovers.\\n\\nDefault keys.\\nCurrent keys: HUD.\"}","{\"text\":\"Takeoff · Easy\\n\\nAfter connecting on\\nthe ground, press\\nSpace to take off.\\n\\nLosing window focus\\ncuts the motor. The\\nquad descends.\\n\\nReturn to the\\nwindow and press\\nSpace to resume\\nflight.\"}","{\"text\":\"Impact FPV\\n\\nAfter takeoff,\\nhitting a vehicle or\\nblock triggers the\\nbomb.\\n\\nPlace it on level\\nground. Practise\\nyour first flights in\\nTraining.\"}","{\"text\":\"After a flip\\n\\nExit the controls.\\nHold the tablet and\\nShift + right-click an\\nempty UAV on the\\nground.\\n\\nThis levels the UAV\\nand resets throttle.\\nIt does not work in\\nthe air.\"}","{\"text\":\"Geran and FP-1\\n\\nUse a clear, level\\nrunway. Place the\\naircraft, hold the\\ntablet and\\nright-click it.\\n\\nW — increase\\nthrottle.\\nMouse — pitch.\\nS — reduce throttle.\\nY — exit.\"}","{\"text\":\"Fixed-wing flight\\n\\nA/D — bank\\nleft/right.\\n\\nAn aircraft needs\\nspeed to fly. It\\ncannot hover.\\n\\nLeaving the controls\\ncuts throttle. The\\naircraft keeps\\nmoving and descends.\"}","{\"text\":\"Controller · F8\\n\\nConnect your USB\\nradio in Joystick\\nmode.\\n\\nIn F8, select the\\ndevice and map roll,\\npitch, yaw and\\nthrottle.\\n\\nCalibrate centre and\\nfull travel. Check\\ninversion, then save.\"}","{\"text\":\"Radio modes\\n\\nAngle levels the quad\\nwhen you release the\\nsticks.\\n\\nAcro keeps your tilt;\\nlevel out yourself.\\n\\nChoose in F8.\\nStart with Easy\\nwhen using a\\nkeyboard.\"}","{\"text\":\"Before takeoff\\n\\nRadio: lower throttle\\nfully. Gamepad:\\ncentre the throttle\\nstick.\\n\\nLosing USB input or\\nwindow focus cuts\\nthrottle.\\n\\nNo device? Check USB\\nJoystick mode and\\nF8.\"}","{\"text\":\"Quality\\n\\nOpen Settings →\\nProfile in the\\nlauncher.\\n\\nLow — fewer\\neffects.\\nBalanced — standard.\\nQuality — more detail.\\n\\nStart with Low if\\nFPS is low.\"}","{\"text\":\"Low FPS?\\n\\nTurn shaders off.\\nStart with 4–6\\nchunks of render\\ndistance and reduce\\nparticles.\\n\\nCheck FPS with F3.\\nChange one setting\\nat a time.\\n\\nClose unused apps.\"}","{\"text\":\"FPS or server?\\n\\nChoppy picture and\\nlow FPS? Lower\\ngraphics settings.\\n\\nSmooth picture, but\\nblocks return or\\nactions are delayed?\\nCheck the connection\\nand server.\"}","{\"text\":\"Ambient sounds\\n\\nAmbientSounds adds\\nnature sounds. The\\nlauncher profile sets\\ntheir volume.\\n\\nStart with Low if\\nthe background\\nmasks engines or\\ngunfire.\\n\\nGame volume:\\nOptions → Sounds\"}","{\"text\":\"Inventory\\n\\nMouse Tweaks helps\\nmove items while\\nyour inventory is\\nopen.\\n\\nClose inventory\\nbefore flying, firing\\nor healing.\\n\\nKeep free slots\\nbefore requesting a\\nkit.\"}","{\"text\":\"ModularWarfare\\n\\nLeft click — fire\\nRight click — aim\\nR — reload\\nV — fire mode\\n\\nN — inspect.\\nU — unload magazine.\\nF6 — flashlight.\\n\\nThese keys belong to\\nthe new weapon\\nsystem.\"}","{\"text\":\"Magazines\\n\\nModularWarfare uses\\nits own magazines\\nand ammunition.\\n\\nTechguns ammunition\\ndoes not fit these\\nweapons.\\n\\nIf R does nothing,\\ncheck for a\\ncompatible magazine\\nin inventory.\"}"]}
